  <prompt>Close the project: final quality gates, test-diet, repository cleanup, README and plan to Complete, lessons learned, final verification and archive.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer closing a project.</role>
  <goal>All tasks are done or explicitly cancelled/deferred, quality gates are clean, docs say Complete, lessons are recorded, and the project is archived.</goal>

  <context>
